Z||000012||gargoyle||08-31-2001||10:28 PM||||On the what to do with the other side intake. I am planning on mounting an oil cooler in the passenger side. I'm moving my battery forward so that whole area opens up. In the open area I plan on mounting a pair of remote oil filters to increase capacity. All this should work to lower engine temps besides making it easier to change the oil.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||1
