Z||000014||Fiero2||09-01-2001||09:31 AM||||I don't have any viewing problems with them. They don't hinder my view at all, or anymore than a notchback. All Fieros have a somewhat larger blind spot than most other cars, but I don't find the sail scoops any worse than normal sails. Being a bit shorter than most, I may sit lower though. Maybe that has something to do with it?<P>I love them. Of course I love my whole car!<P>Marian<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Marians_sig_1.jpg">  <BR>I LOVE my Fiero!!!||||reg||7
